00:17:33.868 --> 00:17:35.349
You can use CloudWatch for monitoring.

451
00:17:35.369 --> 00:17:37.772
You can use VPC endpoints if you want to keep

452
00:17:38.392 --> 00:17:40.555
everything as private as possible and not have

