00:17:40.715 --> 00:17:42.496
traffic going through the public internet.

454
00:17:42.937 --> 00:17:44.559
You can use CloudTrail for auditing.

455
00:17:44.579 --> 00:17:46.581
So all the nice and convenient things you

456
00:17:46.601 --> 00:17:48.583
generally use when you build production ready

457
00:17:48.623 --> 00:17:49.784
systems on AWS.

458
00:17:50.124 --> 00:17:51.345
Of course, there is an alternative.

