962
00:37:01.253 --> 00:37:02.974
So you might hit that when you switch to a

963
00:37:03.014 --> 00:37:05.555
new model from a provider that you haven't used

964
00:37:05.595 --> 00:37:07.495
before, or to a new model you haven't used

965
00:37:07.535 --> 00:37:10.016
before, and your function or your service role

966
00:37:10.036 --> 00:37:11.437
doesn't have marketplace permissions.

967
00:37:13.578 --> 00:37:17.701
If you need to resolve this, and you don't need

968
00:37:17.721 --> 00:37:19.943
to give your Lambda marketplace permissions

969
00:37:20.003 --> 00:37:20.524
permanently.

970
00:37:20.644 --> 00:37:22.165
Instead, just get somebody with the right

971
00:37:22.185 --> 00:37:24.627
permissions to invoke the model once to trigger

972
00:37:24.647 --> 00:37:25.508
the auto subscription.

973
00:37:26.008 --> 00:37:27.429
So you could do that, as we said,

974
00:37:28.050 --> 00:37:29.411
using the Bedrock Playground.

975
00:37:30.792 --> 00:37:33.414
The marketplace subscriptions are per account,

976
00:37:33.474 --> 00:37:35.276
so you'll need to do this in each account as

977
00:37:35.336 --> 00:37:35.516
well.

978
00:37:37.423 --> 00:37:40.326
Now, for the anthropic form we mentioned,

979
00:37:40.446 --> 00:37:41.988
which is separate from the marketplace

980
00:37:42.028 --> 00:37:43.910
subscription, if you complete that at the

981
00:37:43.970 --> 00:37:45.472
management account, that's enough.

982
00:37:46.272 --> 00:37:48.555
And you might have to wait 15 minutes then for

983
00:37:48.595 --> 00:37:49.836
the model to become available.

984
00:37:50.837 --> 00:37:52.559
There is a really weird error you can come

985
00:37:52.599 --> 00:37:52.920
across.

986
00:37:53.180 --> 00:37:54.361
Access denied exception.

987
00:37:54.922 --> 00:37:57.665
Model access is denied due to invalid payment

988
00:37:57.925 --> 00:37:58.325
instrument.

989
00:37:59.186 --> 00:38:01.067
And this happens because some bedrock models are

990
00:38:01.107 --> 00:38:02.909
delivered through AWS Marketplace and the

