00:38:02.949 --> 00:38:05.691
subscription process requires a valid payment

992
00:38:05.731 --> 00:38:05.991
method.

993
00:38:06.931 --> 00:38:10.654
And it documents what payment method issues and

994
00:38:10.674 --> 00:38:12.916
geo-restrictions can cause this.

995
00:38:13.876 --> 00:38:16.198
You can typically hit this when your account has

996
00:38:16.258 --> 00:38:18.319
a payment method that Marketplace doesn't accept

997
00:38:18.379 --> 00:38:19.020
