998
00:38:20.200 --> 00:38:22.621
We've seen this with European accounts using

999
00:38:22.801 --> 00:38:26.362
SEPA or SEPA direct debit system, some

1000
00:38:26.462 --> 00:38:29.802
India-based AISPL accounts, and certain EMEA

