00:38:33.983 --> 00:38:35.644
because those services don't go through the

1004
00:38:35.664 --> 00:38:36.104
marketplace.

1005
00:38:36.464 --> 00:38:38.024
But the moment you try to use the marketplace,

1006
00:38:38.504 --> 00:38:40.305
such as using a bedrock model that requires it,

